      "originalText": "graceful shutdown: https://docs.confluent.io/platform/current/kafka/post-deployment.html#graceful-shutdown\nfile system: https://docs.confluent.io/kafka/design/file-system-constant-time.html\nconfig properties: https://docs.confluent.io/platform/current/installation/configuration/index.html\nzookeeper: https://docs.confluent.io/platform/current/kafka-metadata/zk-production.html\nkraft: https://docs.confluent.io/platform/current/kafka-metadata/kraft.html\nsecurity: https://docs.confluent.io/platform/current/security/overview.html\nflink: https://docs.confluent.io/platform/current/flink/overview.html\nrest proxy: https://docs.confluent.io/platform/current/kafka-rest/index.html\nkafka streams: https://docs.confluent.io/platform/current/streams/overview.html\nksqldb: https://docs.confluent.io/platform/current/ksqldb/overview.html\nversions with descriptions: https://kafka.apache.org/community/downloads/#100",
